# oracle: fix press/langevin tri 0.5 1.0 1.0 on a triclinic LJ liquid (six pistons; the tilt pistons keep native's indices: the yz piston follows Pxy and moves xy, the xy piston follows Pyz and moves yz), temp 1.0 1.0 999, fix nve
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured with native LAMMPS: engine vs native thermo 3.0e-11, atoms 2.2e-12.
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box prism 0 3 0 3 0 3 0.4 -0.3 0.2
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
velocity        all create 1.0 87287 loop all
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all press/langevin tri 0.5 1.0 1.0 temp 1.0 1.0 999
thermo_style    custom step temp pe press pxy pxz pyz lx ly lz xy xz yz vol
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
run             200
